<title>HONG KONG: holdHK CPI (A) rises annual 5.8 pct in November.</title>
<headline>holdHK CPI (A) rises annual 5.8 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following consumer price index data showing Hong Kong's CPI (A) rose 5.8 percent in November year-on-year.</p>
